{"completed": true, "response": "<escape>{\n  \"better\": \"X\",\n  \"regress\": \"有。X在S11把“对方也许需要他”的猜想稍微写实成了“对方有时也需要他”，削弱了人物始终不确定的心理；S14也弱化了“等真的到了那时再说”的从容感。\",\n  \"nets\": {\n    \"scan\": \"X\",\n    \"point\": \"X\",\n    \"why\": \"Y\",\n    \"whole\": \"平\",\n    \"fine\": \"X\"\n  },\n  \"why\": \"X把叙事拆成短小、有重点的语义单元，【】能让观众扫一眼就抓住每段心理变化，感受又与话语分层，并通过到时出现贴合音乐进程，阅读节奏更容易掌握。Y的完整句子在解释人物动机、呈现因果关系和保留心理转折的细微程度上更好，但左右两侧的信息需要来回切换，右侧短词也容易形成情绪词堆积。综合而言，X更容易让普通观众在听音乐的同时既跟上故事，又获得具体的感官体验。\"\n}</escape>", "metadata": {"session_handle": "a7093fe5-9c23-453c-869b-78f873f5231e", "session_revision": 0, "session_ttl_max_hours": 6, "job_directory": "D:\\musicclaude\\gpt2agent-safechain\\runs\\gpt4\\pro-bridge-20261107T194640246701Z", "elapsed_seconds": 83.282, "completed_utc": "2026-11-07T19:48:03.538361+00:00", "model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "temporary": true, "unpersonalized": true, "generation_policy_verified": true, "request_policy": {"model": "gpt-6-thinking", "thinking_effort": "max", "history_and_training_disabled": true, "temporary_chat_requests_personalization": false, "is_do_not_remember": false, "continuation": false, "unpersonalized_inherited_verified": false, "body_sha256": "9538b56245bf1ede628a75507bfdc96d10a547801c35f081e4b751d60354759f", "attachment_count": 0}, "stream_completion": {"sse_done": true, "message_completed": true, "independent_terminal_verified": true}, "profile": "Nozomi Kasaki / gpt4", "account_sha256": "bbd4fd636d4b6714d2b42b89e341bdb5bbe7c34f7d141aec76b444be8343fe54", "transport": "probridge-pure-http", "resume_requests": 0, "topic_connections": 0, "browser_started": false, "Docker_used": false, "automatic_retry": false, "initializer_pss_limit_mib": "not_applicable_no_browser", "attachment_count": 0, "code_sha256": {"tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_cli.py": "96a4cdb6cd5d982f4d1de5b6ba8fae0cf23ee44aa3e41d7fdf6968e3fb590e48", "tools\\chatgpt_web\\gpt3_sessions.py": "83a3ed4ae1efa9f1a2b8ee3f144cc0dc9f668f995a33cc4222308cb3fa31f683", "tools\\c